\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Worship the Lord in the beauty of holiness !
\par Bow down before Him, His glory proclaim;
\par With gold of obedience and incense of lowliness,
\par Kneel and adore Him, the Lord is His name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Low at His feet lay thy burden of carefulness,
\par High on His heart He will bear it for thee,
\par Comfort thy sorrows, and answer thy prayerfulness,
\par Guiding thy steps as may best for thee be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Fear not to enter His courts in the slenderness       
\par Of the poor wealth thou wouldst reckon as thine :
\par Truth in its beauty and love in its tenderness :
\par Thee are the offerings to lay on His shrine,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. These, tongues we bring them in trembling and fearfulness,
\par He will accept for the name that is dear;
\par Morning of joy give for evenings of tearfulness,
\par Trust for our trembling, and hope for our fear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O worship the Lord in the beauty of holiness !
\par Bow down before Him, His glory proclaim ;
\par With gold of obedience and incense of holiness,
\par Kneel and adore Him, the Lord is His name. 
\par                                                          Amen
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

